0 WaveMaker — Cardan-differential ripple oscillator
0 Name: wavemaker.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/wavemaker.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One fixed SPIKE Prime hub; one medium angular motor, explicit port A.
0 // Two equal 36.869897645844-degree Cardan bends; one reversed branch.
0 // 6573 carrier uses supported 16T rim only; 8T output takeoff magnifies angle by two.
0 // Two physical universal-joint crosses are required in addition to these 298 placements.
0 // Native import infers those crosses from the four actual fork parts.
0 // Misphased middle forks deliberately preserve angular ripple.
0 // Reset to this saved datum before running programs/wavemaker.bw.
0 // Actual LDraw meshes remain external with their original authors and licenses.
0 // Assembly: 01 — staggered base rails and pinned hub
